Package: cureAssess
Type: Package
Title: Assessing Cure Model Appropriateness for Survival Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Geethanjalee",
      family = "Mudunkotuwa",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "geethanjaleem@gmail.com"
    )
Description: Provides tools for assessing whether cure models are appropriate
    for right-censored survival data. The package implements a two-stage
    workflow including Kaplan-Meier visualization, parametric cure and
    non-cure model comparison using AIC, and diagnostic procedures such as
    Maller-Zhou statistics, Shen's test, immune summaries, and the RECeUS method.
